WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:01.760
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:01.941 --> 00:00:03.581
I'm a humpback whale.

3
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.342
We are large sea mammals.

4
00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:35.945
Where do you live?

5
00:00:35.965 --> 00:00:39.747
Humpback whales live in the ocean.

6
00:00:41.689 --> 00:00:44.931
We travel very far every year.

7
00:00:47.752 --> 00:00:49.013
Where do you travel?

8
00:00:50.554 --> 00:00:52.916
We live in cold water in the summer.

9
00:00:56.032 --> 00:00:58.955
We swim to warm water for the winter.

10
00:01:02.358 --> 00:01:03.380
What do you eat?

11
00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:08.044
We eat small sea creatures and fish.

12
00:01:10.647 --> 00:01:13.269
Humpback whales are good hunters.

13
00:01:30.764 --> 00:01:32.025
I hear a song!

14
00:01:33.986 --> 00:01:37.067
Humpback whales make lots of sounds.

15
00:01:39.109 --> 00:01:41.350
Males even sing songs.

16
00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:46.793
Sometimes they sing for hours.

17
00:01:53.737 --> 00:01:55.678
Is that a hump on your back?

18
00:01:57.219 --> 00:02:03.100
No. That's my back fin.

19
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.502
It's small and looks like a hump.

20
00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:12.048
You have a big tail!

21
00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:16.472
Our tails help us jump out of the water.

22
00:02:18.214 --> 00:02:21.096
Humpback whales love to splash.

23
00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.440
Watch this.

24
00:02:27.762 --> 00:02:35.557
Splash! Good-bye!

25
00:02:35.577 --> 00:02:39.643
Good-bye, Humpback Whale!
